<title>UK: B.A.T down on weaker U.S. tobaccos.</title>
<headline>B.A.T down on weaker U.S. tobaccos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in B.A.T Industries were down 7-1/2p at 472-1/2 by 0910 GMT after a weak finish by Philip Morris in New York last Friday, market makers said.</p>
<p>On Wall Street last Friday Philip Morris ended $2-3/4 down at $111.</p>
<p>&quot;We haven't seen a lot of volume but Morris was down on Friday and that has encouraged a bit of selling,&quot; one market maker said.</p>
<p>Trading volume was around 270,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
